    <briefdescription>
<para>Class with methods to propagate synthetic entry counts. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class is templated on the type of the call graph and designed to work with the traditional per-module callgraph and the summary callgraphs used in ThinLTO. This contains only static methods and alias templates. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
